    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755190/extras/5a5bbe453edd98c6cc7088054896d7cb.poster.avif?t=1753469640\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755190/extras/5a5bbe453edd98c6cc7088054896d7cb.webm?t=1753469640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755190/extras/5a5bbe453edd98c6cc7088054896d7cb.mp4?t=1753469640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>G!</strong> is the hardest 2D platformer ever made, a mind-bending challenge that twists your perception of gravity, space, and movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by a frenetic electronic soundtrack, every level is a test of skill, reflexes and sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755190/extras/520ae2a19b6089455947647aa528f078.poster.avif?t=1753469640\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755190/extras/520ae2a19b6089455947647aa528f078.webm?t=1753469640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755190/extras/520ae2a19b6089455947647aa528f078.mp4?t=1753469640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 21 challenging levels, <strong>G!</strong> experiments with your perception and feeling of movement like never has been done before in a 2D platformer, will you be able to finish it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character with 24 unlockable skins in each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755190/extras/0cd3087c6a38cca64a74fa3e01786c40.poster.avif?t=1753469640\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755190/extras/0cd3087c6a38cca64a74fa3e01786c40.webm?t=1753469640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755190/extras/0cd3087c6a38cca64a74fa3e01786c40.mp4?t=1753469640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755190/extras/5a5bbe453edd98c6cc7088054896d7cb.poster.avif?t=1753469640\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755190/extras/5a5bbe453edd98c6cc7088054896d7cb.webm?t=1753469640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755190/extras/5a5bbe453edd98c6cc7088054896d7cb.mp4?t=1753469640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>G!</strong> is the hardest 2D platformer ever made, a mind-bending challenge that twists your perception of gravity, space, and movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by a frenetic electronic soundtrack, every level is a test of skill, reflexes and sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755190/extras/520ae2a19b6089455947647aa528f078.poster.avif?t=1753469640\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755190/extras/520ae2a19b6089455947647aa528f078.webm?t=1753469640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755190/extras/520ae2a19b6089455947647aa528f078.mp4?t=1753469640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 21 challenging levels, <strong>G!</strong> experiments with your perception and feeling of movement like never has been done before in a 2D platformer, will you be able to finish it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character with 24 unlockable skins in each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755190/extras/0cd3087c6a38cca64a74fa3e01786c40.poster.avif?t=1753469640\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755190/extras/0cd3087c6a38cca64a74fa3e01786c40.webm?t=1753469640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755190/extras/0cd3087c6a38cca64a74fa3e01786c40.mp4?t=1753469640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Think you're good at platformers? G! is the hardest 2D platformer ever made, a mind-bending challenge that twists your perception of gravity, space, and movement. Powered by a frenetic electronic soundtrack, every level is a test of skill, reflexes and sanity.",
